---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';

const base = 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dj76bnpni/image/upload/';

const propertyTypes: { label: string; href?: string }[] = [
  { label: 'Office Buildings' },
  { label: 'Retail/Shopping Centers' },
  { label: 'Industrial Properties' },
  { label: 'Multi-family Residential Buildings' },
  { label: 'Hotels and Motels' },
  { label: 'Restaurants' },
  { label: 'Healthcare Facilities' },
  { label: 'Educational Buildings' },
  { label: 'Sports Facilities' },
  { label: 'Entertainment Venues' },
  { label: 'Automotive Facilities' },
  { label: 'Farming and Agricultural Facilities' },
  { label: 'Special Purpose Properties' },
  { label: 'Fishing Lodges', href: '/hunting-fishing-lodge-appraisals' },
  { label: 'Hunting Lodges', href: '/hunting-fishing-lodge-appraisals' },
  { label: 'Golf Courses', href: '/ontario-golf-course-appraisals' },
  { label: 'Marinas' },
  { label: 'Airports and Airfields' },
  { label: 'Self-Storage Units' },
  { label: 'Vacant Land' },
];
---

<ServicePage
  title="Commercial Appraisals | Morland Real Estate Appraisals"
  description="Commercial property appraisals in North Bay and area. Trusted by investors, banks, credit unions, lawyers and accountants for accurate, detailed valuations."
  heroImage={`${base}f_auto,q_auto,w_1920/v1788982280/commercial-property-appraisal-north-bay_u0mexx.jpg`}
  heroAlt="Commercial property in North Bay"
  heroTitle="Commercial Appraisals"
  heroLede="In North Bay and the surrounding area, the commercial property market can be complex and difficult to price. For this reason, you need an appraiser with a deep understanding of our market."
  formHeading="Request a commercial appraisal"
  formIntro="Fill out the form to be contacted by one of our appraisal specialists to see how we can help you!"
  bandImage={`${base}f_auto,q_auto,w_1920/v1788982280/commercial-property-appraisal-banner_oohxex.png`}
  bandAlt="Commercial property in the North Bay area"
>
  <h2>Value Your Commercial Property</h2>
  <p>In North Bay, the commercial property market can be complex and difficult to price. For this reason, you need an appraiser with a deep understanding of our market. Morland Real Estate Appraisals is well-known as the area's leader, trusted by investors, banks, credit unions, lawyers and accountants for accurate commercial valuations. We pride ourselves on detail-oriented appraisals for all types of commercial properties.</p>
  <p>While creating a commercial real estate appraisal, we will visit the location and perform an in depth appraisal using the appropriate value approach method required (cost, income, or direct sales, subdivision, discounted cash flow, etc). We will then create and deliver a high quality, detailed appraisal report.</p>
  <p>As your partner, you can trust us to produce impartial appraisals that are based on our unique understanding of commercial real estate legislation, current local trends, and a thorough analysis of the specific property, whether it's a retail shop, multi-unit housing complex, warehouse, or any other commercial structure.</p>
  <p class="phone-line">We want to help your business succeed. Call us at <a href="tel:+17054743500">(705) 474-3500</a> to discuss your upcoming commercial appraisal.</p>

  <h2>We Appraise Commercial Properties</h2>
  <ul class="checklist">
    {propertyTypes.map((type) => (
      <li>{type.href ? <a href={type.href}>{type.label}</a> : type.label}</li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</ServicePage>
